{% extends "_layout.twig" %}

{% set title = "August 2026 Donation Drive" %}
{% set description = "Support the development of Principia by donating during the August 2026 donation drive." %}

	{% block content %}
<h1>August 2026 Donation Drive</h1>

<p>
	Principia is a highly advanced physics-based sandbox game featuring circuitry, robotics, Lua scripting and more.
	Being originally developed as a proprietary game between 2012 and 2014, it was later abandoned due to financial issues.
	In 2022, the game's source code was released allowing the community to continue development and maintain the game.
	<a href="/about">Read more on the About Principia page</a>.
</p>

<p>
	It has now gone 4 years since the game was released as open source, with ROllerozxa serving as the project maintainer for the majority of that time.
	He's the primary driving force for the game's development, being the sole person working on the game at this point as well as maintaining the community site and wiki.
	You can read more about the game's journey as an open source project in the <a href="/news/32">Four years of Open Source Principia</a> news article.
</p>

<p>
	This campaign seeks to raise financial support for the project to allow continued development of the game and cover the costs associated with running the community site.
</p>

<div class="header_message">
	🎉 The campaign was successful and the goal has been reached! Thanks to everyone below who contributed to help us reach the goal.<br><br>
	The <a href="/luascript-api-cheatsheet">Principia LuaScript Cheatsheet</a> is now freely available to download.
</div>

<h2>The goal</h2>

<p>
	The initial goal to be reached was {{ goal | number_format(2) }} Swedish krona. This corresponds to around 1 year of infrastructure costs.
</p>

<div class="campaign-progress">
    <div class="bar">
        <div class="bar-fill" style="width: {{ donation_progress }}%;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="labels">
        <span class="step" style="left: {{ donation_progress }}%;">
            {{ total_donations | number_format(2) }} SEK
        </span>
    </div>
</div>

<p>
	If the goal is reached, the <a href="/luascript-api-cheatsheet">Principia LuaScript Cheatsheet</a> will be released freely (CC-BY 4.0).
</p>

<p>Thanks to the people who have donated:</p>

<ul class="donators-list">
	{% if total_donations == 0 %}
		<li><em>No donations yet... Be the first one!</em></li>
	{% else %}
		{% for donator in donators %}
			<li>{{ donator.name }} - {{ donator.amount }} SEK</li>
		{% endfor %}
	{% endif %}
</ul>

<h2>Donate</h2>

<p>The primary ways of donating are either through Liberapay or Ko-Fi. Liberapay is primarily intended for recurring donations, but you can still make a one-time donation by cancelling after the first payment.</p>

<a href="https://liberapay.com/ROllerozxa/donate" target="_blank">
	<img alt="Donate using Liberapay" title="Donate using Liberapay" src="/assets/donate-liberapay.svg" width="170"></a>

<a href="https://ko-fi.com/rollerozxa" target="_blank">
	<img alt="Donate using Ko-fi" title="Donate using Ko-fi" src="/assets/donate-kofi.svg" width="170">
</a>
	{% endblock %}